  data: {
    LLM: "Identify your partner immediately. If you hold a Black Queen, watch who plays the other one.\n\nCounting the 16: You absolute MUST remember all 16 cards. If you see two Aces of off-suits played, you know the remaining two are high-risk targets for trumping.\n\nThe Gran Lead: In a Gran bid, where only Jacks are trump, high-ranking suits (Aces and Tens) become much more powerful. Lead your strongest suit to flush out the opponents' Jacks.",
